==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|HeartGold & SoulSilver|Jynx|69}} from the {{TCG|HeartGold & SoulSilver}} expansion.
*'''Attract Smack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Boundaries Crossed|Togepi|110}} from the {{TCG|Boundaries Crossed}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

